{
  "name": "Qliph-Scarred (Chthonic): What the Deep Dark Taught You",
  "type": "feat",
  "img": "art/bbttcc/GOTTGAIT/BBTTCC%20Button%20Icons/BBTTCC_button_icon_dream_monster.png",
  "system": {
    "category": "technique",
    "source": "Bad Eden Heritages v1.1 (RFI-native rules)",
    "tags": [],
    "description": {
      "value": "<div data-ft-canon-qliph-scarred=\"v1\" style=\"display:none\"></div><p><em>\"There are ways to move that the sun never got to review.\"</em></p><p><strong>What the Deep Dark Taught You (1/Soma Break).</strong> Bonus action — sink partially into shadow, earth, or stone. For up to 1 minute, while sunken you gain:</p><ul><li><p>Reroll the lowest die on Stealth (Intrigue) checks.</p></li><li><p>Difficult terrain costs you no extra movement.</p></li><li><p>You can move through spaces 1 square wide.</p></li><li><p>Resistance to qliphothic damage.</p></li></ul><p>The effect ends early if you are fully submerged in running water or take sephirotic damage.</p><div data-ft-per-use=\"1\" data-ft-per-use-key=\"qliphChthonicDeepDark\" style=\"margin-top:0.7rem;padding:0.55rem 0.75rem;border:1px solid #b08acc;border-radius:0.35rem;background:rgba(70,55,95,0.18);\"><p><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.04em; text-transform: uppercase; color: #d4b8e8; margin-bottom: 0.25rem; font-size: 0.78rem\">⟁ Per-Use Ability — <strong>What the Deep Dark Taught You</strong></span> <span style=\"opacity: 0.92; line-height: 1.4; font-size: 0.86rem\"><strong>Recovery:</strong> 1/Soma Break  ·  <strong>Action:</strong> Bonus action (1-min duration)  ·  <strong>Use:</strong> Click this feature on your sheet to invoke.</span> <span style=\"opacity: 0.85; margin-top: 0.3rem; font-size: 0.82rem\">Sink into shadow/earth/stone for up to 1 min: reroll-lowest on Stealth · ignore difficult terrain · squeeze through 1 square gaps · resist qliphothic damage. Ends early on running water or sephirotic damage.</span></p></div>",
      "chat": ""
    },
